#!/bin/bash
#PBS -N mot2d_scree
#PBS -q zeus_combined_q
#PBS -J 0-8
#PBS -l select=1:ncpus=200:mem=64gb
#PBS -l walltime=10:00:00

set -euo pipefail
cd /home/tal.noa/ytterbium_lab_simulation_new || exit 1
module load SPACK/apps
module load gcc/14.1.0
module load python/3.14.2
source ~/venvs/atomsmltr/bin/activate
RUN_TMP="/tmp/${USER}_mot2d_scree_${PBS_JOBID}_${PBS_ARRAY_INDEX:-0}"
mkdir -p "${RUN_TMP}"
export TMPDIR="${RUN_TMP}" TMP="${RUN_TMP}" TEMP="${RUN_TMP}"
trap 'rm -rf -- "${RUN_TMP}"' EXIT
python -m studies.mot_2d_s0_campaign screen-task --campaign data/optimization/mot_2d/s0_campaign_130_135_140_sep2026 --task-index $PBS_ARRAY_INDEX
